      "key": "SFCC-141",
      "summary": "Order Management – Dynamic Buffer Stock Rules Engine",
      "description": "Sub-Functional Area:\n Buffer Stock\nDescription:\n The system will provide a dynamic buffer stock rules engine in SFCC Business Manager allowing business users to create, view, pause, edit and delete buffer rules without dev dependency or bulk re-upload, operating in a manner consistent with promotion and campaign rule logic. Rules will support configuration at SKU, category, colour and season level, selection by storefront or all storefronts, AP21 subcategory or all, product attribute or all, and multiple simultaneous active rules\nStatus:\n Under Review\nNotes:\nNotes: Not supported in current Magento implementation\nAccenture Additional Notes: In SFCC, we can configure per storefront, or per product. No possible per category or sub-category. In product attributes from AP21, there is a product attribute that manages that stock buffer per product. Do you want to continue using that, or do you want SFCC to override it?\nZimm Response: Is it possible to export Products based on attributes (e.g. season, color, category) and then bulk update buffer stock for those Products?\nAccenture Notes: \n(blank)\nSizing:\n No sizing required if BM functionality and users can bulk update?",
