ge detection capability are key inputs to the SFCC integration approach. | P0 | * Initial full import followed by deltas |\n| P-M2b | Product Sync | If delta — what is the change signal AP21 uses (last-modified timestamp, event, flag)? | ❓ | P0 |  |\n| P-M2c | Product Sync | What is the approximate catalogue volume — number of master styles and total variant SKUs in the current export? | ❓ | P0 |  |\n| P-M3a | Product Sync | Is the AP21 → Magento product feed triggered on a schedule, on AP21 product publish/update event, or both? If scheduled — what is the interval? | ❓ Sets the expected freshness SLA for SFCC. | P0 | * scheduler based (cron job) |\n| P-M3b | Product Sync | How quickly does a product change in AP21 become live on Magento today — minutes, hours, or overnight? | ❓ | P0 |  |\n| P-M4 | Product Sync | When a product is archived or suppressed in AP21, how does Magento know to take it offline — does AP21 send an explicit status flag, or is the product simply absent from the next feed? | ❓ SFCC merge mode will keep a product live indefinitely if it is merely absent — an explicit offline signal is required. | P0 | * Done inmagento natively |\n| P-M5a | Product Sync | Does MuleSoft transform the AP21 product payload before Magento receives it, or does Magento consume the raw AP21 format directly? | ❓ For SFCC, MuleSoft will need to produce a new output format — understanding re-use potential of the current mapping. | P0 | * Raw ap21 xml |\n| P-M5b | Product Sync | If MuleSoft transforms — where is the field mapping defined (MuleSoft DataWeave, a config file, or a mapping table)? | ❓ | P0 |  |\n| P-M6 | Error Handling | Does the MuleSoft failure alert for the product feed include individual failed product IDs, or only a job-level notification? | ✅ Known: 3 retries, automated email alert on failure. Confirm: per-product IDs or job-level only? | P1 |  |\n\n---\n\n3-price-sync-ap21--mulesoft--sfcc3. Price Sync (AP21 → MuleSoft → SFCC)\n---------------------------