1bd-51cb-bb30-e1f34d43b15c\",   \"message\": \"Order created successfully\"   }   } |\n| O3 | Orders | What happens if `orders-prc-api` does not respond within 30 seconds — does MuleSoft have an async fallback or does the checkout fail? | ❓ A customer-charged-but-not-fulfilled scenario must be mitigated. | P0 | * Fails and Magento sets to -1/0 ( have to check) * Needs to be checked and reexported |\n| O4a | Orders | Does MuleSoft perform a stock check against NewStore before creating the order? | ❓ | P0 | * No - allocation done later |\n| O4b | Orders | If NewStore rejects due to OOS post-checkout, how does MuleSoft notify SFCC? | ❓ | P0 | * Not handled here. * Should be reallocated or cancelled later |\n| O5 | Orders | Does MuleSoft read the SFCC site ID from the order payload to determine NewStore fulfilment routing (e.g. ZimmermannUK → UK NewStore, ZimmermannAU → AU NewStore)? | ✅ Known: SFCC sends orderId → MuleSoft fetches full order. Confirm site routing behaviour. | P0 | * Gets data from order payload * Sent in magento order data |\n| O6a | Orders | Is the NewStore order ID returned to SFCC for storage after order creation? | ✅ Known: NewStore uses ZX-prefix format (e.g. ZX00000339). Confirm it is returned in the response. | P0 | * Native order id sent back |\n| O6b | Orders | How does `orders-prc-api` resolve the SFCC customer ID to NewStore customer orders for My Account reconciliation? | ❓ | P0 | * customer email from magento response - TBC |\n| O7 | Orders | Is the rewards split calculation (0-value orders) performed in MuleSoft before sending to NewStore, or does SFCC send pre-calculated values? | ✅ Known: rewards split formula documented in order TSD. Confirm which side calculates. | P1 | * Some claculatio is done in Mulesoft based on Magento data which may have some calculation there.  TBC |\n\n---\n\n6-order-history--returns-sfccpwa--mulesoft--realtime6. Order History & Returns (SFCC/PWA → MuleSoft) — Real-Time\n----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n| # | Domain | Question | What we need | Priority | Response |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| OH1 | Order History | What are the SFCC-context endpoint names and production URLs for order list, order detail, and returns? | ✅ Known: current URLs use `magento-exp-api-dev` (e.g. `https://mw.staging.zimmermann.com/magento-exp-api-dev/api/orders`). Confirm the renamed SFCC endpoints — PWA My Account development is blocked without these. | P0 |  |\n| OH2 | Order History | What is the maximum `count` per request on the order history endpoint, and what is the default if omitted? | ✅ Known: `offset` and `count` params supported. Confirm the limit. | P1 |  |\n| OH4 | Returns | Is the `/returns` endpoint live in MuleSoft and what is the response schema? | ✅ Known: separate `GET /returns?customer_id={id}` endpoint documented. Confirm it is live and provide schema — return ID, status, items, refund amount. | P1 |  |\n| OH5 | Customer | Is the SFCC customer ID stored in NewStore at order creation time, or does MuleSoft maintain a cross-reference (e.g. Anypoint Object Store)? | ❓ Required for My Account order history resolution. | P0 | * TBC |\n\n6-order-history--returns-sfccpwa--mulesoft--realtime7. Sample Payloads (MuleSoft)\n---------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n| # | Domain | Question | What we need | Priority | Response |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|  | Product | Please provide the sample product payload that goes into Magento and and raw payload of AP21 |  |  |  |\n|  | Price | price payload that goes into Magento and raw payload of AP21 |  |  |  |\n|  | Inventory | price inventory payload that goes into Magento and raw payload of AP21 - Newstore |  |  |  |\n|  | Order Submit | order payload that goes into Newstore |  |  |  |\n|  | Order History | Order history response |  |  |  |\n|  | Order detail | Order detail response |  |  |  |\n|  | Return | Return detail response |  |  |  |\n|  | Find in store | Find in store detail response |  |  |  |\n|  | Real time stock | API spec endpoint for real time stock check and sample request and response |  |  |  |\n|  | Customer | Sample customer Payload from omneo |  |  |  |",
