er data passed to MuleSoft, as noted in the existing Magento configurations (including but not limited to: product name, product category, product material/composition, and duties paid or flag (DDP or DDU)), to support generation of custom commercial invoices for international shipments and returns | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed | Additional Note: The Global-e connector stores 2 x transaction data in Magento, the B2B and B2C transaction data  @Tim Lavelle @Isabel Chaloner Do we know what this comment is about? |",
