{"result":"{
  "metadata": {
    "id": "292192262",
    "title": "Create Order Integration",
    "type": "page",
    "created": "",
    "updated": "",
    "url": "https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/SFCC/pages/292192262",
    "space": {
      "key": "SFCC",
      "name": "Adobe SFCC"
    },
    "version": 2,
    "attachments": [],
    "content": {
      "value": "Overview\n--------\n\n| Item | Detail |\n| --- | --- |\n| JIRA | ZMOBLD-785 |\n| API Name | `orders-prc-api` |\n| Bitbucket | tryzenssalesforce / zimmermann-uk-rollout |\n| Technical Owner | Parth Gupta |\n\n---\n\nHigh Level Summary\n------------------\n\nWhen a customer places an order on SFCC, SFCC sends the **order ID** to MuleSoft. MuleSoft fetches the full order details from SFCC, transforms the payload, and submits it to **NewStore** to create the order in the OMS.\n\nThe same Process API also handles: - **Narvar Returns (Store):** NewStore webhook → MuleSoft → Narvar (return linked in tracking system) - **Narvar Returns to 3PL:** Narvar return portal → MuleSoft → 3PL SFTP (return shipped label + data)\n\n---\n\nFlow: Create Order\n------------------\n\nnonewide4000SFCC ──[orderId]──► orders-prc-api\n│\nFetch order details from SFCC\n│\nTransform to NewStore schema\n(split qty, apply discounts/rewards, round)\n│\nPOST ──► NewStore\n\n### Key Mapping Rules\n\n| Rule | Detail |\n| --- | --- |\n| Item quantity | Adobe/SFCC quantity > 1 is split into individual line items (NewStore has no qty field) |\n| 0-value orders (rewards) | Payment array set to blank; shipping discount applied at item level |\n| Price | Mapped from `extension_attributes.price` (recalculated value) |\n| Tax (no rewards) | `item_tax_amount / quantity` |\n| Tax (with rewards) | `tax_pct × (price - discounts - rewards)` |\n| Discounts | `total_discount / quantity` |\n| Rewards | Split proportionally: `((item_price - item_discount) × total_rewards) / (subtotal + order_discount)` |\n| Rounding | Discrepancies adjusted on last item of each product; final reconciliation adjusts last product price |\n\n---\n\nFlow: Narvar Returns (Store)\n----------------------------\n\nnonewide4000NewStore ──[return.processed webhook]──► orders-prc-api ──► Narvar\n\n---\n\nFlow: Narvar to 3PL Returns\n---------------------------\n\nnonewide4000Narvar ──[return\\_initiated\\_standard]──► orders-prc-api ──► 3PL SFTP (+ Narvar S3 cache, 60 days)\n\n---\n\nAPI Endpoints\n-------------\n\n### Create Order\n\n| Environment | URL | Method |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Local | `http://0.0.0.0:8081/api/order?orderId={id}` | GET |\n| Dev | `https://mw.staging.zimmermann.com/magento-exp-api-dev/api/order?orderId={id}` | GET |\n| QA | `https://mw.staging.zimmermann.com/magento-exp-api-qa/api/order?orderId={id}` | GET |\n| Prod | `https://mw.staging.zimmermann.com/magento-exp-api/api/order?orderId={id}` | GET |\n\n### Narvar to 3PL Return\n\n| Environment | URL | Method |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Dev | `https://mw.staging.zimmermann.com/narvar-exp-api-dev/api/returns` | POST |\n| QA | `https://mw.staging.zimmermann.com/narvar-exp-api-qa/api/returns` | POST |\n\n### NewStore to Narvar Return\n\n| Environment | URL | Method |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Dev | `https://mw.staging.zimmermann.com/newstore-exp-api-dev/api/webhooks/returns` | POST |\n| QA | `https://mw.staging.zimmermann.com/newstore-exp-api-qa/api/webhooks/returns` | POST |\n\n---\n\nSample Payloads\n---------------\n\n### Create Order — Request\n\nnonewide4000orderId=EU000142927\n\n### Create Order — Response\n\njsonwide4000{\n\"code\": \"200\",\n\"message\": \"success\",\n\"response\": {\n\"order\\_id\": \"anc3485\",\n\"message\": \"Order created successfully\"\n}\n}\n\n### Narvar Returns (Newstore → Narvar) — Response\n\njsonwide4000{ \"message\": \"Event received successfully\" }\n\n---\n\nError Handling\n--------------\n\n| HTTP Status | Message | Scenario |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 400 | Invalid request payload | Input validation failure |\n| 401 | Invalid or Missing token | Missing/incorrect auth token |\n| 404 | Customer not found | Order ID does not exist |\n| 500 | Internal server error | Any unexpected server error |\n\n---\n\nNon-Functional Requirements\n---------------------------\n\n| Requirement | Value |\n| --- | --- |\n| Monitoring | Anypoint Platform |\n| Retry strategy | 3 retries |\n| Response time | ≤ 2.5 seconds |",
      "format": "markdown"
    },
    "page_width": "max"
  }
}"}

