    "content": {
      "value": "Overview\n--------\n\nMuleSoft acts as the middleware layer (API Gateway) connecting Salesforce Commerce Cloud (SFCC) with back-end systems including NewStore (OMS), AP21 (inventory), Narvar (returns), and 3PL. All MuleSoft APIs follow a layered architecture: **Experience API → Process API → System API**.\n\n**Base URL:**`https://mw.staging.zimmermann.com/`\n\n---\n\nIntegration Summary\n-------------------\n\n| # | Integration | API Name | Source | Target | Trigger |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 | Create Order | `orders-prc-api` | SFCC | NewStore | Order placed on SFCC |\n| 2 | Order History & Details | `order-transactions-sync-prc-api` | SFCC | NewStore | My Account page load |\n| 3 | Find In Store / Boutique Stock | `product-availibility-prc-api` | SFCC | NewStore | PDP / Store Details page |\n| 4 | DC Stock Upload | `stock-prc-api` | AP21 | NewStore | Scheduled (daily 2AM EST) |\n| 5 | Store Stock Upload | `stock-prc-api` | AP21 | NewStore | Scheduled / one-time full load |\n| 6 | Narvar Returns (Store) | `orders-prc-api` | NewStore webhook | Narvar | Return processed in store |\n| 7 | Narvar Returns to 3PL | `orders-prc-api` | Narvar | 3PL SFTP | Return initiated via Narvar portal |\n\n---\n\nArchitecture\n------------\n\nDefaultnoneSFCC Storefront\n│\n├──► Experience API (SFCC-facing entry point, auth + transformation)\n│ │\n│ └──► Process API (business logic, orchestration, routing)\n│ │\n│ └──► System API (NewStore / AP21 / Narvar / 3PL connector)\n│\n└──► Anypoint Runtime Manager (monitoring, scheduler control)\n\n---\n\nEnvironments\n------------\n\n| Environment | Base URL Pattern |\n| --- | --- |\n| Dev | `https://mw.staging.zimmermann.com/{api-name}-dev/api/` |\n| QA | `https://mw.staging.zimmermann.com/{api-name}-qa/api/` |\n| Prod | `https://mw.staging.zimmermann.com/{api-name}/api/` |\n\n---\n\nNon-Functional Standards\n------------------------\n\n| Requirement | Value |\n| --- | --- |\n| Monitoring | Anypoint Platform Runtime Manager |\n| Retry strategy | 3 retries, 1-minute interval |\n| Response time SLA | ≤ 2.5 seconds |\n| Error alerting | Automated email on integration failure |\n| Security | HTTPS + client credentials (client\\_id / client\\_secret) via Mule secure property placeholder |\n\n---\n\nSub-pages\n---------\n\n* Create Order Integration\n* Customer Order Transactions Sync\n* Find In Store / Boutique Stock\n* DC & Store Stock Upload",
      "format": "markdown"
    },
    "page_width": "fixed-width"
  }
}"}

